@SemanticImageSearch.API_HostAddress = http://localhost:5256

### Search by text
GET {{SemanticImageSearch.API_HostAddress}}/api/search?query=dog%20on%20the%20beach&limit=10
Accept: application/json

### Search by text within a date-taken range (both dates inclusive)
GET {{SemanticImageSearch.API_HostAddress}}/api/search?query=dog%20on%20the%20beach&from=2023-01-01&to=2023-12-31&limit=10
Accept: application/json

### Search by text taken on or after a date
GET {{SemanticImageSearch.API_HostAddress}}/api/search?query=birthday%20cake&from=2024-06-01
Accept: application/json

### Get available recognized people
GET {{SemanticImageSearch.API_HostAddress}}/api/people
Accept: application/json

### Search for images containing both selected people (query is optional)
GET {{SemanticImageSearch.API_HostAddress}}/api/search?people=Alice&people=Bob&limit=10
Accept: application/json

### Get an image by id (replace with an id from a search result)
@imageId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
GET {{SemanticImageSearch.API_HostAddress}}/api/images/{{imageId}}

###
